/** @page api_core Core implementation reference (internal)

This is the **internal implementation reference**. Search and the Files and
Namespaces trees expose private helpers and classes where Doxygen can extract
them. Being indexed does not make a symbol public or installed. Each file page
links to the line-numbered source, including implementations not compiled into
the default SDK-free build.

@section provider_contracts Common provider contracts

These `gige_mel::provider_detail` classes and hooks describe the current private
implementation, not a camera-provider subclass API. The @ref api_installed page
remains the consumer/embedding/backend contract; @ref api_extensions describes
the separate profile/backend composition interfaces.

- **Session state and Control:** @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::Runtime "Runtime",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ControlImpl "ControlImpl",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ControlImpl::init(const std::string&) "ControlImpl::init",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ControlImpl::getCapabilities() "ControlImpl::getCapabilities",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ControlImpl::attachChannel(const ir::Config&) "ControlImpl::attachChannel",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ControlImpl::detachChannel(std::shared_ptr<ir::Channel>) "ControlImpl::detachChannel".
- **Shared channels and callbacks:** @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore "ChannelCore",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::enable() "ChannelCore::enable",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::disable() "ChannelCore::disable",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::detach_locked() "ChannelCore::detach_locked",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::configure_locked "ChannelCore::configure_locked",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::registerMetadataCallback(std::function<void(ir::Channel&,const ir::ChannelCommsTestRep*const)>) "ChannelCore::registerMetadataCallback(ChannelCommsTestRep)",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::register_callback "ChannelCore::register_callback",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::admit_callback "ChannelCore::admit_callback",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::invoke "ChannelCore::invoke",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::CallbackGuard "CallbackGuard",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::NavigationSubmissionGuard "NavigationSubmissionGuard".
- **Buffers and frame delivery:** @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::HostBuffer "HostBuffer",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::registerBuffer(std::shared_ptr<ir::Buffer>) "ChannelCore::registerBuffer",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::unregisterBuffer(std::shared_ptr<ir::Buffer>) "ChannelCore::unregisterBuffer",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::HostBuffer::unbind() "HostBuffer::unbind",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::HostBuffer::cancel_fill() "HostBuffer::cancel_fill",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::HostBuffer::release() "HostBuffer::release",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::StreamState "StreamState",
  @ref gige_mel::provider_detail::ChannelCore::run "ChannelCore::run",
